<item>
  <title>Adding a new setup guide</title>
  <dc:creator>Rito Ghosh</dc:creator>
  <link>https://ritog.github.io/steps/steps/adding-a-guide/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<p>This site keeps each setup process in its own directory. That makes it easy to keep screenshots, scripts, and downloadable files next to the guide that uses them.</p>
<section id="create-a-directory" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="create-a-directory">1. Create a directory</h2>
<p>Create a short, URL-friendly directory under <code>steps/</code>:</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb1" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode numberSource bash number-lines code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode bash"><span id="cb1-1"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">mkdir</span> <span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">-p</span> steps/my-new-guide</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Use lowercase words separated by hyphens. Once a guide is published, avoid renaming its directory so existing links continue to work.</p>
</section>
<section id="add-the-guide" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="add-the-guide">2. Add the guide</h2>
<p>Create <code>steps/my-new-guide/index.qmd</code> with this front matter:</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb2" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode numberSource yaml number-lines code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode yaml"><span id="cb2-1"><span class="pp" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">---</span></span>
<span id="cb2-2"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">title</span><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">:</span><span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"> </span><span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"Set up the thing"</span></span>
<span id="cb2-3"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">description</span><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">:</span><span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"> </span><span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"What the reader will have working by the end."</span></span>
<span id="cb2-4"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">author</span><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">:</span><span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"> </span><span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"Rito Ghosh"</span></span>
<span id="cb2-5"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">date</span><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">:</span><span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"> </span><span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"2026-10-15"</span></span>
<span id="cb2-6"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">categories</span><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">:</span><span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"> </span><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">[</span><span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">tool-name</span><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">,</span><span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"> setup</span><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">]</span></span>
<span id="cb2-7"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">toc</span><span class="kw" style="color: #003B4F;
background-color: null;
font-weight: bold;
font-style: inherit;">:</span><span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;"> </span><span class="ch" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">true</span></span>
<span id="cb2-8"><span class="pp" style="color: #AD0000;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">---</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Then write the process using numbered level-two headings:</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb3" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode numberSource markdown number-lines code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode markdown"><span id="cb3-1"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">## 1. Install the dependency</span></span>
<span id="cb3-2"></span>
<span id="cb3-3">Explain the step and show the command.</span>
<span id="cb3-4"></span>
<span id="cb3-5"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">## 2. Configure the service</span></span>
<span id="cb3-6"></span>
<span id="cb3-7">Explain the next step.</span>
<span id="cb3-8"></span>
<span id="cb3-9"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">## 3. Verify the setup</span></span>
<span id="cb3-10"></span>
<span id="cb3-11">Show how the reader can confirm that everything works.</span></code></pre></div></div>
</section>
<section id="keep-commands-reproducible" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="keep-commands-reproducible">3. Keep commands reproducible</h2>
<p>Use fenced code blocks and name the language where possible:</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb4" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode numberSource markdown number-lines code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode markdown"><span id="cb4-1"><span class="in" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">```bash</span></span>
<span id="cb4-2"><span class="bu" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">command</span> <span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">--flag</span> value</span>
<span id="cb4-3"><span class="in" style="color: #5E5E5E;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">```</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>State where each command should run, call out values that must be replaced, and include the expected result after important steps.</p>
</section>
<section id="preview-locally" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="preview-locally">4. Preview locally</h2>
<p>From the repository root, run:</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb5" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode numberSource bash number-lines code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode bash"><span id="cb5-1"><span class="ex" style="color: null;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">quarto</span> preview</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Quarto rebuilds the site as files change. Confirm that the guide appears on the home page, its category links work, and all commands and links are correct.</p>
</section>
<section id="publish" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="publish">5. Publish</h2>
<p>Commit the source files and push the <code>master</code> branch:</p>
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode" id="cb6" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode numberSource bash number-lines code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode bash"><span id="cb6-1"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">git</span> add steps/my-new-guide</span>
<span id="cb6-2"></span>
<span id="cb6-3"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">git</span> commit <span class="at" style="color: #657422;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">-m</span> <span class="st" style="color: #20794D;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">"Add my new setup guide"</span></span>
<span id="cb6-4"></span>
<span id="cb6-5"><span class="fu" style="color: #4758AB;
background-color: null;
font-style: inherit;">git</span> push origin master</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>The GitHub Actions workflow renders the Quarto project and publishes it to GitHub Pages.</p>


</section>

